@url = http://localhost:3000
@token = your-jwt-here

### Get All Profiles
GET {{url}}/profiles


### Get Profile id
GET {{url}}/profiles/7b9fec13-e974-4a9e-a965-3e9f86cafadd



### Post a profile
POST {{url}}/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

